    <rdfs:label>Encounter: onleave in progress states</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>States of the onleave in progress path of the Encounter workflow, in order: onleave, in-progress. A transition is legal between adjacent states. The FHIR Encounter lifecycle: planned, arrived, triaged, in progress, on leave, finished, cancelled.</rdfs:comment>
