    <rdfs:label>Encounter: in progress entered in error states</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>States of the in progress entered in error path of the Encounter workflow, in order: in-progress, entered-in-error. A transition is legal between adjacent states. The FHIR Encounter lifecycle: planned, arrived, triaged, in progress, on leave, finished, cancelled.</rdfs:comment>
